    "title": "RCA Smart TV Remote",
    "description": "<b>Why RCA Smart TV Remote Control</b>\r\nConvert your mobile device into RCA Smart TV Remote and get rid of drained batteries and broken plastic remotes. \r\n\r\n<b>Supported RCA Smart TV's</b>\r\n<b>- -</b> Supports All RCA Smart TV with Android OS OR Android TV Remote\r\n\r\nThis remote control for RCA Smart TV supports <b>Android OS</b> and Traditional <b>IR</b> devices.\r\n\r\n<b>Network Compatibility</b>\r\nTo use RCA Smart TV Remote your RCA Smart TV and your mobile device must be on the same Wi-Fi Network, once the Smart TV is detected then you will have to Enter the <b>PIN</b> shown on TV to start using RCA Smart TV Remote.\r\n\r\n<b>Traditional IR Devices</b>\r\nSupports all traditional RCA TV's, your phone must have IR blaster in it for using the RCA TV Remote Control .\r\n\r\n<b> Functionality </b>\r\n- ON / OFF \r\n- Volume Control's\r\n- Channel Control's\r\n- Mute\r\n- Navigation Control's\r\n- Multi Media Control's\r\n- Home\r\n- Touch Pad\r\n- Many More\r\n- For Traditional RCA TV Remote, supports all the functions in the remote.\r\n\r\n<b> Android TV </b>\r\nIn addition to RCA Smart TV, our Remote Control for RCA Smart TV Supports Android Chromecast OS.\r\n\r\n<b> Smart TV Remote Can be used </b>\r\n- RCA Android TV Remote\r\n- RCA Remote Smart TV \r\n\r\n<b>Disclaimer</b>\r\nThis app is not an official RCA application. We are not affiliated with RCA Inc in any way, we have just presented it in a better way.\r\n\r\n<b>Reach Us</b>\r\nIf in any case your RCA Smart TV Remote is not getting connected please reach us at nabasmarttvremote@gmail.com. We are always working to improve our product.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Why RCA Smart TV Remote Control</b><br>Convert your mobile device into RCA Smart TV Remote and get rid of drained batteries and broken plastic remotes. <br><br><b>Supported RCA Smart TV&#39;s</b><br><b>- -</b> Supports All RCA Smart TV with Android OS OR Android TV Remote<br><br>This remote control for RCA Smart TV supports <b>Android OS</b> and Traditional <b>IR</b> devices.<br><br><b>Network Compatibility</b><br>To use RCA Smart TV Remote your RCA Smart TV and your mobile device must be on the same Wi-Fi Network, once the Smart TV is detected then you will have to Enter the <b>PIN</b> shown on TV to start using RCA Smart TV Remote.<br><br><b>Traditional IR Devices</b><br>Supports all traditional RCA TV&#39;s, your phone must have IR blaster in it for using the RCA TV Remote Control .<br><br><b> Functionality </b><br>- ON / OFF <br>- Volume Control&#39;s<br>- Channel Control&#39;s<br>- Mute<br>- Navigation Control&#39;s<br>- Multi Media Control&#39;s<br>- Home<br>- Touch Pad<br>- Many More<br>- For Traditional RCA TV Remote, supports all the functions in the remote.<br><br><b> Android TV </b><br>In addition to RCA Smart TV, our Remote Control for RCA Smart TV Supports Android Chromecast OS.<br><br><b> Smart TV Remote Can be used </b><br>- RCA Android TV Remote<br>- RCA Remote Smart TV <br><br><b>Disclaimer</b><br>This app is not an official RCA application. We are not affiliated with RCA Inc in any way, we have just presented it in a better way.<br><br><b>Reach Us</b><br>If in any case your RCA Smart TV Remote is not getting connected please reach us at nabasmarttvremote@gmail.com. We are always working to improve our product.",
